{
  "name": "AA | 0. Setup – Register Slash Commands",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Run once\nRegisters /help /cv /job /answer on your server. App and server ids come from `.env` (DISCORD_APP_ID, DISCORD_GUILD_ID). Click *Execute workflow*.",
